    "body": "This is caused by https://github.com/rust-lang/rust/blob/2885c474823637ae69c5967327327a337aebedb2/library/std/src/sys/windows/path.rs#L104-L116 used by `has_root` not supporting multi-character drives, as in, not supporting PowerShell provider paths, but only real Windows paths.",
